            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>Notes: counts are not adjusted for traffic volume. Crashes are assigned to the LGA of their location; Moreland and Merri-bek (renamed in 2022) are reported together as MERRI-BEK. Only complete years can be selected, because recent months are published with a lag. Source: Department of Transport and Planning, Victoria road crash data (CC BY 4.0).</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Segoe UI</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <Color>#57606A</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
